class QgsVbScriptNode
{
%Docstring(signature="appended")
Represents an abstract node for a VBScript script.

VBScript node subclasses are either:

- statements (inheriting :py:class:`QgsVbSriptStatement`), such as a
  variable declaration, if statement, for loop.
- or expressions (inheriting :py:class:`QgsVbScriptExpression`), which
  are a portion of a statement representing an expression. For example
  ``1+2``, ``Upper('A string')``, or literals like ``255`` or ``'a
  string'``.

.. versionadded:: 4.4
%End

%TypeHeaderCode
#include "qgsvbscript.h"
%End
